  "surface": "What sits on the page: cards, fields, popovers, dialogs, panels and headers. Every screen starts on white. The `surface` input of `defineTheme` sets it, and with it derives `surface-tint`, the soft tone backdrops and, on a dark surface, the light action colours.",
  "surface-tint": "The surface's second step: wells, hovered rows, table headers, footers, empty slots and the information tone's tint. Derived from `surface` by shifting its lightness 0.1 toward the foreground (0.06 the other way on a dark surface), in the brand hue: chroma 0.02 in light and dark themes (never more than the brand has; a neutral grey with `contrast: \"high\"`). About 1.1:1 against white, so never a boundary on its own.",
